1.  **`add_item`**: Changed the assignment from `inventory[name] = qty` (which overwrote existing stock) to `inventory[name] = inventory.get(name, 0) + qty` so that quantities accumulate.
2.  **`total_value`**: Changed `prices[name]` to `prices.get(name, 0)` to ensure items missing from the price dictionary are treated as having a value of 0 instead of raising a `KeyError`.

